        },
        {
          "text": "’Ba wura opale opari edepi, kani wura edele aya rap acisirisi, afa Yehovani ngule onzi, on duou ma dri pamvururi edepi, eri edrepi uru ndindiruri, ma ovu trizaru. ’Ba dria ma omvi e’yo, ma ’yo, Amena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
